      "rationale": "Before the launch freezes step details, this binds each relative Markdown link inside each detail from that detail's own corpus source: a link whose target is another step detail is bound to that detail's per-request frozen path beside the report, and any other link to its absolute corpus source path. It then recomputes the detail's revision from the bound bytes, so the recorded revision is the digest of the exact content the agent is given.",
      "role": "primary-authority"
    },
